@@ -0,0 +1,5 @@
+---
+'@radix-ui/react-slot': patch
+---
+
+Use a stable composed ref in `Slot` so function refs are only invoked on mount/unmount, not re-invoked on every render. This fixes infinite update loops (`Maximum update depth exceeded`) with React 19 when a slotted ref callback schedules an update (eg. editor frameworks like Slate/Plate).
